    <string name="heading_accessibility">Accessibility</string>
    <string name="accessibility_explanation">With TalkBack, slide a finger over the keys to hear them, and lift it to type the key you hear; a double tap types the last key heard. Rest on a key for three seconds, or double-tap and hold, for what a long press does: digits on the top row of the Zhuyin keyboard, choosing an input method on the space bar. Candidates above the keys are read when touched; double-tap one to choose it.</string>
